# STORY (Year 1 research + story), batch 4: the stock X-COM research tree, retired.
# Nothing is deleted. Each retired topic depends on STR_STORY_LOCK (never researchable) and opens nothing, so it
# never shows. Kept (BUILD to re-link to G.I. Joe topics): plasma = pulse weapons and clips, blaster, small
# launcher, stun bomb, alien grenade (= Cobra Grenade, gijoe_research_captured.rul), mind probe, the three craft
# topics, laser pistol/rifle/heavy/cannon, plasma cannon, fusion missile, laser and plasma defense, mind shield,
# psi lab, hyper-wave decoder. Loads after gijoe_research_spine.rul: only the fields listed here change.
research:
- name: STR_LASER_WEAPONS
